{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"馬太福音","commonName":"馬太福音","title":"馬太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"e6a69bcdfd211081fa073a66ee44527641bf01e2b254542670bcdb48a7363864","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1071},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶穌受試探"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["後來，耶穌隨聖靈的引導來到曠野，受魔鬼的試探。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶穌禁食了四十晝夜後，很饑餓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["試探者前來對祂說：「你如果是上帝的兒子，就叫這些石頭變成食物吧。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶穌回答說：「聖經上說，『人活著不是單靠食物，而是靠上帝口中的每一句話。』",{"noteId":9},"」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["魔鬼又帶祂進聖城，讓祂站在聖殿的最高處，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["說：「你如果是上帝的兒子，就跳下去吧！因為聖經上說，『上帝會吩咐祂的天使用手托住你，不讓你的腳碰在石頭上。』",{"noteId":10},"」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶穌回答說：「聖經上也說，『不可試探主你的上帝。』",{"noteId":11},"」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["魔鬼再帶耶穌到一座極高的山上，把世上萬國及其榮華展示給祂看，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["說：「如果你俯伏敬拜我，我就把這一切都給你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶穌說：「撒旦，走開！聖經上說，『要敬拜主你的上帝，單單事奉祂。』",{"noteId":12},"」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["於是魔鬼離開了耶穌，這時有天使前來伺候祂。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["開始傳道"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶穌聽見約翰被捕入獄，就回到加利利。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["後來，祂離開拿撒勒去迦百農居住。迦百農靠近湖邊，在西布倫和拿弗他利地區。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["這就應驗了以賽亞先知的話："]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"「西布倫、拿弗他利、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沿海一帶及約旦河東、外族人居住的加利利啊！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那住在黑暗中的人看見了大光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"活在死蔭之地的人被光照亮了！」","poem":1},{"noteId":13}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["從那時起，耶穌開始傳道：「悔改吧，因為天國臨近了！」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["呼召門徒"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶穌沿著加利利湖邊走，看見被稱為彼得的西門和他弟弟安得烈正向湖裡撒網。他們是漁夫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耶穌對他們說：「來跟從我！我要使你們成為得人的漁夫。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["他們立刻撇下漁網，跟從了耶穌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶穌再往前走，又看見雅各和約翰兩兄弟正與父親西庇太在船上補網。耶穌呼召他們，"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["他們馬上離開漁船，辭別父親，跟從了耶穌。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["教導和醫治"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["耶穌走遍加利利，在各個會堂裡教導人，傳講天國的福音，醫治人們各樣的疾病。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["祂的名聲傳遍了整個敘利亞。人們把一切患病的，就是被各種疾病和疼痛折磨的、癲癇的、癱瘓的，以及被鬼附身的都帶到祂面前，祂就醫治了他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["因此，有大群的人跟從了祂，他們來自加利利、低加坡里、耶路撒冷、猶太和約旦河東。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"申命記8·3。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":4}},{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇91·11、12。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":6}},{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"申命記6·16。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":7}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"申命記6·13。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":10}},{"noteId":13,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書9·1、2。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}